            "code": "// LeetCode 315: for each i, how many later elements are smaller?\nvector<int> countSmaller(const vector<int>& nums) {\n    vector<int> vals(nums);                      // compress values to 1..m\n    sort(vals.begin(), vals.end());\n    vals.erase(unique(vals.begin(), vals.end()), vals.end());\n    Fenwick seen(vals.size());                   // counts per value\n    vector<int> out(nums.size());\n    for (int i = (int)nums.size() - 1; i >= 0; --i) {\n        int v = lower_bound(vals.begin(), vals.end(), nums[i]) - vals.begin() + 1;\n        out[i] = seen.prefix(v - 1);             // later values < nums[i]\n        seen.add(v, 1);\n    }\n    return out;\n}",
